65","quote":"文公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p066:m0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p066","quote":"文公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事暫定身份；稱號同字不跨時代合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p009","quote":"襄公元年，以女弟繆嬴為豐王妻。襄公二年，戎圍犬丘，世父擊之，為戎人所虜。歲餘，復歸世父。七年春，周幽王用褒姒廢太子，立褒姒子為適，數欺諸侯，諸侯叛之。西戎犬戎與申侯伐周，殺幽王酈山下。而秦襄公將兵救周，戰甚力，有功。周避犬戎難，東徙雒邑，襄公以兵送周平王。平王封襄公為諸侯，賜之岐以西之地。曰：「戎無道，侵奪我岐、豐之地，秦能攻逐戎，即有其地。」與誓，封爵之。襄公於是始國，與諸侯通使聘享之禮，乃用騮駒、黃牛、羝羊各三，祠上帝西畤。十二年，伐戎而至岐，卒。生文公。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin","source_term":"生"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji005-028","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"y97_huh_vuz"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000347"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","mention_count":9,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0052","c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0055","c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0071","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0000","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0015","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0093","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0119","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0131","c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0180"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:p008","c-shiji-005-qin:p009"],"passage_count":2},{"source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:p053:m0138","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p065:m0000","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p106:m0001"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:p053","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p065","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p106"],"passage_count":3},{"source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m009-0022"],"paragraph_i